  "The Repair Tool and the EOD Bot share the standard repair amount 40; in the 'ActiveRepair' state the tool holds 60 and the bot 75. What sets the ActiveRepair state is not read here.",
  "Anti-repair (applied to enemy vehicles) is 30 standard and 45 in the ActiveRepair state for both.",
  "The apply interval is 0.1 s for both; range is 2 m for the tool and 3.2 m for the bot.",
  "If the amount is health per second, a tank takes 30 s from 0 to full at 40 and 20 s at 60, and the vehicle's own regeneration (120 per second for a tank, L3346) is three times faster than a standard repair. That contrast is a reason to doubt the plain health-per-second reading rather than a result."
 ],
